<title>PORTUGAL: TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ESTORIL, Portugal 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results</p>
<p>of the Estoril Open men's tournament on Friday (prefix numbers</p>
<p>denote seeding):</p>
<p>8-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Gilbert Schaller (Austria) 6-0</p>
<p>4-1 (Schaller retired with a leg injury)</p>
<p>6-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Fabrice Santoro (France) 6-3 4-0</p>
<p>(Santoro retired with a back injury)</p>
</text>
